{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"zhangyan-e-f59ce3d13c3c03b0e9a1","title":"西使张奉于孙权前列尚书阚泽姓名以嘲泽，泽不能答","accounts":[{"id":"zhangyan-a-f59ce3d13c3c03b0e9a1","label":"正文","text":"西使张奉于孙权前列尚书阚泽姓名以嘲泽，泽不能答","evidence":["zhangyan-q-c948969ca66dbc379831"]}],"participants":[{"person":"zhangyan-p-fa07c67d0c2106","role":"列名嘲阚泽者","evidence":["zhangyan-q-c948969ca66dbc379831"]},{"person":"santizhu-p0172","role":"受嘲者","evidence":["zhangyan-q-c948969ca66dbc379831"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["zhangyan-q-c948969ca66dbc379831"]},"ordering_evidence":"zhangyan-q-c948969ca66dbc379831","order":9511},{"id":"zhangyan-e-5de7fd376af7f8378645","title":"张奉曰不当复列君吴邪，薛综应声曰无口为天、有口为吴，君临万邦、天子之都，众坐喜笑而奉无以对","accounts":[{"id":"zhangyan-a-5de7fd376af7f8378645","label":"正文","text":"张奉曰不当复列君吴邪，薛综应声曰无口为天、有口为吴，君临万邦、天子之都，众坐喜笑而奉无以对","evidence":["zhangyan-q-8c161d370575a14d470d"]}],"participants":[{"person":"zhangyan-p-fa07c67d0c2106","role":"反问者","evidence":["zhangyan-q-8c161d370575a14d470d"]},{"person":"wuzhu-p0071","role":"应声而对者","evidence":["zhangyan-q-8c161d370575a14d470d"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["zhangyan-q-8c161d370575a14d470d"]},"ordering_evidence":"zhangyan-q-8c161d370575a14d470d","related_events":[{"event":"zhangyan-e-9be7f75b396aaaf45846","type":"alternative","evidence":["zhangyan-q-68c00acd393499233c41","zhangyan-q-8c161d370575a14d470d"]}],"order":9513}],"persons":[{"id":"zhangyan-p-fa07c67d0c2106","name":"张奉（蜀使）","evidence":["zhangyan-q-c948969ca66dbc379831","zhangyan-q-8c161d370575a14d470d","zhangyan-q-19365b039b7d96c81fd9"],"facts":[],"mentions":[{"id":"zhangyan-m-2a0744b330f8f064998f","kind":"mention","text":"本篇原文记及张奉，具体行动与称谓见引文。","evidence":["zhangyan-q-19365b039b7d96c81fd9"]}],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"zhangyan-q-19365b039b7d96c81fd9","section":"chapter-053","block":"b-3c35b505bf673b119ca8","layer":"original","quote":"西使张奉，于权前列尚书阚泽姓名以嘲泽〖3〗，泽不能答。综下行酒〖4〗，因劝酒曰：“蜀者何也〖5〗？有犬为独，无犬为蜀；横目苟身〖6〗，虫入其腹。”﹝二﹞奉曰：“不当复列君吴邪？”综应声曰：“无口为天，有口为吴；君临万邦，天子之都！”于是众坐喜笑，而奉无以对。其枢机敏捷〖7〗，皆此类也。﹝三﹞","section_title":"张严程阚薛传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0113.xhtml","index":152,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":146},{"id":"zhangyan-q-68c00acd393499233c41","section":"chapter-053","block":"b-e4b2e8a7fefc9ded675c","layer":"pei","quote":"费祎聘于吴，陛见，公卿侍臣皆在坐。酒酣，祎与诸葛恪相对嘲难，言及吴、蜀。祎问曰：‘蜀字云何？’恪曰：‘有水者濁，无水者蜀。横目苟身，虫入其腹。’祎复问：‘吴字云何？’恪曰：‘无口者天，有口者吴；下临沧海，天子帝都。’","attribution":"裴注·江表传","section_title":"张严程阚薛传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0113.xhtml","index":164,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-59fd308c6e14f37e6004","start":11,"end":119},{"id":"zhangyan-q-8c161d370575a14d470d","section":"chapter-053","block":"b-3c35b505bf673b119ca8","layer":"original","quote":"奉曰：“不当复列君吴邪？”综应声曰：“无口为天，有口为吴；君临万邦，天子之都！”于是众坐喜笑，而奉无以对","section_title":"张严程阚薛传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0113.xhtml","index":152,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":76,"end":128},{"id":"zhangyan-q-c948969ca66dbc379831","section":"chapter-053","block":"b-3c35b505bf673b119ca8","layer":"original","quote":"西使张奉，于权前列尚书阚泽姓名以嘲泽〖3〗，泽不能答","section_title":"张严程阚薛传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0113.xhtml","index":152,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":26}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
